WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.435
-Good evening, everybody.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:03.870
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.805
And now we are going to
get to the news.

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:08.941
The House committee
investigating the Capitol attack

00:00:08.941 --> 00:00:10.810
held its first public hearing
tonight,

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.979
where they called
their first witness --

00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:14.814
literally all of us.

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:18.718
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:22.155
That's right. The January 6th
committee aired a 90-minute

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:24.324
hearing tonight,
which was carried live by all

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:26.526
the major news networks
except Fox News.

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:29.429
Though Fox ended up with
better ratings by just

00:00:29.429 --> 00:00:31.865
airing the original Capitol
attack.

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:34.300
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.635
President Biden criticized
the Republican Party

00:00:36.635 --> 00:00:38.938
in a new interview and said
it has undergone

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:42.241
a "radical shift" since former
President Trump was elected.

00:00:42.241 --> 00:00:45.111
I don't know. I think they were
always this radical

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:49.015
and then they elected a guy
who couldn't be subtle about it.

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:51.651
It's like when you're at a
dinner party and you whisper to

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:53.553
your wife,
"Dinner parties suck."

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:56.089
And then she says,
"Dinner parties suck?!"

00:00:56.089 --> 00:00:57.257
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.257 --> 00:00:59.092
And then you have to say,
"Okay, yes, I think

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:00.593
dinner parties suck, everybody."

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:02.027
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.027 --> 00:01:05.030
President Biden said yesterday
that he is often asked why

00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:08.568
he does not play the political
games that the Republicans play

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:11.070
and said, "If we do
the same thing they do,

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:13.572
our democracy will literally
be in jeopardy."

00:01:13.572 --> 00:01:14.874
Okay, you know, there was

00:01:14.874 --> 00:01:18.577
a televised insurrection hearing
tonight, right?

00:01:18.577 --> 00:01:20.379
It's already in jeopardy.

00:01:20.379 --> 00:01:22.882
That's like the captain
of the Titanic saying,

00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:24.917
"I'm worried everyone
running to one side

00:01:24.917 --> 00:01:26.185
isn't good for the boat."

00:01:26.185 --> 00:01:29.322
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:31.691
Republican Senator John Kennedy
criticized

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:34.027
the Biden administration
yesterday for not doing more

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:37.496
to bring down high gas prices
and added that it would be cot--

00:01:37.496 --> 00:01:40.533
excuse me -- it would be quote
"cheaper to buy

00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:42.401
cocaine and just run
everywhere."

00:01:42.401 --> 00:01:44.604
Which --
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:48.007
That's a pretty --
pretty cute joke.

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:49.308
But mostly I want to know,

00:01:49.308 --> 00:01:52.478
where are you getting
a gallon of cocaine for $6?

00:01:52.478 --> 00:01:53.879
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.879 --> 00:01:55.782
Don't be stingy, Jack.

00:01:55.782 --> 00:01:58.784
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.784 --> 00:02:01.887
Arizona Republican Senate
candidate Blake Masters

00:02:01.887 --> 00:02:04.724
reportedly met with conservative
activists earlier this year

00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:08.694
at a Phoenix IHOP and suggested
that the Capitol attack may have

00:02:08.694 --> 00:02:11.463
been a false-flag operation
set up by the FBI,

00:02:11.463 --> 00:02:14.800
which is absolutely
the least crazy idea

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:16.803
ever pitched at a Phoenix IHOP.

00:02:16.803 --> 00:02:19.272
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:21.307
Today was National Sex Day.

00:02:21.307 --> 00:02:22.308
Eww.

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:24.176
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.176 --> 00:02:26.245
During the day?

00:02:26.245 --> 00:02:33.686
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:37.523
A group of pro-choice, topless
protesters with green paint on

00:02:37.523 --> 00:02:40.392
their chests stormed the court
of a WNBA game

00:02:40.392 --> 00:02:41.694
in Brooklyn this week,

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:44.030
but the NYPD announced that
no charges were filed.

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:45.898
Apparently, they couldn't make
an arrest

00:02:45.898 --> 00:02:47.934
because nobody saw their faces.

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:52.905
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.905 --> 00:02:54.507
"Oh, not I!"

00:02:54.507 --> 00:02:56.342
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.342 --> 00:02:59.078
"There's no way I would not look
at a face."

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:02.881
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.881 --> 00:03:05.718
The cosmetics company Nails Inc
recently launched

00:03:05.718 --> 00:03:08.087
a line of cheese-scented
nail polishes.

00:03:08.087 --> 00:03:12.825
Or if that's too expensive,
just eat one handful of Cheetos.

00:03:12.825 --> 00:03:15.328
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.328 --> 00:03:18.097
And finally, a man in Wales
broke a Guinness world record

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:21.333
after drinking at 56 pubs
in 24 hours.

00:03:21.333 --> 00:03:24.236
It was for Most Sober Man
in Wales.

00:03:24.236 --> 00:03:25.504
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:25.504 --> 00:03:27.773
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

00:03:27.773 --> 00:03:30.910
Oh, man, do we have a great show
for you tonight.

